---
<lem-type Note extends Page>
  banner: string = brand()
  layout: (Note, html): html
</lem-type>

<lem-fn brand(): string = site.name />

`brand` reads `site`, which is fine where it stands — a layout may call it — but a
default reads only the record it builds, and the link step names the call that reaches
out of it.
